## Pre-Merge Checklist
- [ ] Commit subject follows Conventional Commit format.
- [ ] MR description is complete and clear.
- [ ] Impacted repos are identified correctly.
- [ ] Impacted targets are listed explicitly.
- [ ] Risk and rollback plan are documented.
- [ ] Validation evidence is included.
- [ ] No credentials/secrets are exposed in this MR.
